もう そんなんじゃ ほら
no, that's not enough, look!

5
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,400
心は進化するよ
My heart will keep evolving,

6
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:34,200
もっと もっと
more and more!

7
00:03:50,100 --> 00:03:53,600
言葉にすれば消えちゃう関係なら
If our relationship would just disappear once put into words,

8
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:57,600
言葉を消せばいいやって思ってた 恐れてた
I thought I should just erase the words—I was scared.

9
00:03:57,600 --> 00:04:00,900
だけどあれ？ なんか違うかも
Wait, huh? Maybe something's different...

10
00:04:00,900 --> 00:04:04,700
千里の道も一歩から！
Even a journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step!

11
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:08,500
石のように固い そんな意志で
With a determination as solid as stone,

12
00:04:08,500 --> 00:04:12,700
塵も積もればやまとなでしこ？
even dust piled up makes an ideal maiden?

13
00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:15,500
『し』抜きで いや 死ぬ気で！
Without "shi"—no, with all my might!

14
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:19,400
ふわふわり ふわふわる
Fluffy, floating, drifting, wandering...

15
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:22,000
あなたが名前を呼ぶ
When you call my name,

16
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:25,000
それだけで宙へ浮かぶ
just that makes me float into the air.

17
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:29,000
ふわふわる ふわふわり
Drifting, wandering, fluffy, floating...

18
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,500
あなたが笑っている
When you're smiling,

19
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:34,600
それだけで笑顔になる
just that brings a smile to my face.

20
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:38,200
神様 ありがとう
Dear God, thank you so much!

21
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:42,500
運命の悪戯でも
Even if it's just a prank of fate,

22
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:46,400
めぐり逢えたことが
being able to meet you

23
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:49,900
しあわせなの
makes me so happy.

24
00:04:49,900 --> 00:04:52,200
でも そんなんじゃ だめ
But that won't do,

25
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:54,100
もう そんなんじゃ ほら
no, that's not enough, look!

26
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:56,500
心は進化するよ
My heart will keep evolving,

27
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:58,500
もっと もっと
more and more!

28
00:04:58,500 --> 00:05:00,600
そう そんなんじゃ やだ
Yeah, I don't want it like that!

29
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:03,000
ねえ そんなんじゃ まだ
Hey, that's not quite enough yet!

30
00:05:09,748 --> 00:05:13,648
私の中のあなたほど あなたの中の私の存在は
My presence within you isn't nearly as big...

31
00:05:13,848 --> 00:05:17,748
まだまだ大きくないことも 分かってるけれど
...as your presence is within me, I know, but still...

32
00:05:17,848 --> 00:05:21,948
今この同じ瞬間 共有してる時間
Right now in this very moment, this time that we share...

33
00:05:22,048 --> 00:05:26,148
塵も積もればやまとなでしこ？ 略して ちりつもやまとなでこ！
"Dust piled up makes a Yamato Nadeshiko"? In short, "Chiritsumo Yamato Nadeko"!

34
00:05:26,348 --> 00:05:30,148
くらくらり くらくらる あなたを見上げたら
Getting so dizzy, spinning around... Just looking up at you,

35
00:05:30,148 --> 00:05:33,948
それだけで 眩しすぎて
is dazzling enough on its own.

36
00:05:34,048 --> 00:05:37,848
くらくらる くらくらり あなたを想っている
Spinning around, getting so dizzy... Just thinking of you,

37
00:05:37,848 --> 00:05:41,948
それだけで 溶けてしまう
is enough to make me melt away.

38
00:05:42,048 --> 00:05:45,948
神様 ありがとう
God, thank you so much,

39
00:05:45,948 --> 00:05:49,848
運命の悪戯でも
even if it's just a trick of fate...

40
00:05:49,848 --> 00:05:57,748
めぐり逢えたことが しあわせなの
being able to meet you brings me so much happiness.

