めぐり逢えたことが しあわせなの
being able to meet you brings me so much happiness.

52
00:07:19,948 --> 00:07:23,648
でも そんなんじゃ だめ もう そんなんじゃ ほら
But that won't do; no, not like that, look!

53
00:07:23,648 --> 00:07:27,648
心は進化するよ もっと もっと
My heart will keep evolving more and more!

54
00:07:27,648 --> 00:07:31,548
そう そんなんじゃ やだ ねえ そんなんじゃ まだ
Yeah, I don't want it like that; hey, not like that yet!

55
00:07:31,548 --> 00:07:37,148
私のこと 見ててね ずっと ずっと
Keep your eyes on me forever and ever!

56
00:08:20,948 --> 00:08:24,948
「聞こえますか…？」激情奏でる ミュージック
"Can you hear it...?" The music playing pure passion...

57
00:08:24,948 --> 00:08:27,948
天に解き放て
Unleash it to the heavens!

58
00:08:27,948 --> 00:08:31,848
「聴こえますか…？」イノチ始まる脈動
"Can you hear it...?" The pulse where life begins...

59
00:08:31,848 --> 00:08:34,848
愛を突き上げて
Thrust up your love!

60
00:08:34,848 --> 00:08:39,648
遥か (彼方) 星が (音楽となった…彼の日)
Far, far away, on that day the stars became music...

61
00:08:39,648 --> 00:08:43,148
風が (髪を) 攫う (瞬間)
The moment the wind swept through our hair,

62
00:08:43,148 --> 00:08:47,348
君と僕はコドウを詩にした
you and I turned our heartbeats into song.

63
00:08:47,348 --> 00:08:49,848
そして (夢は) (開くよ)
And then, our dreams will open up,

64
00:08:49,848 --> 00:08:55,348
見た事ない世界の果てへ…
to the ends of an unseen world...

65
00:08:55,548 --> 00:08:58,848
Yes, just believe

66
00:08:58,848 --> 00:09:04,448
神様も知らない ヒカリで歴史を創ろう
Let's create history with a light unknown even to God!

67
00:09:04,448 --> 00:09:08,548
逆光のシャワー 未来照らす
A shower of backlighting illuminating the future...

68
00:09:08,548 --> 00:09:11,648
一緒に飛ばないか
Won't you fly with me?

69
00:09:11,648 --> 00:09:17,548
Just feeling 涙で濡れた羽根 重くて羽撃けない日は
Just feeling, on days your wings are wet and too heavy with tears to flap...

70
00:09:17,548 --> 00:09:20,948
Wish その右手に添えよう
Wish, I will place beside your right hand...

71
00:09:20,948 --> 00:09:25,148
僕のチカラも
my power too!

72
00:09:25,148 --> 00:09:28,948
二人で行けば 翼になれる
If we go together, we can become wings!

73
00:09:28,948 --> 00:09:32,948
Singing heart

74
00:09:48,948 --> 00:09:52,848
いつの日にか解る時が来るから
Because the time will surely come when you understand...

75
00:09:52,848 --> 00:09:55,948
ずっと…忘れない
Never... forget.

76
00:09:55,948 --> 00:09:59,548
その時には心のあるがままに
At that time, just as your heart desires...

77
00:09:59,548 --> 00:10:01,948
笑顔…忘れない
Don't forget... to smile.

78
00:10:03,023 --> 00:10:05,223
きっと (僕と) 君は (君は)
Surely, you and I...

79
00:10:05,223 --> 00:10:08,023
一羽の鳥のように
...like a single bird,

80
00:10:08,123 --> 00:10:10,923
遠い (過去も) 手と手繋ぎ
holding hands even in the distant past,

81
00:10:11,023 --> 00:10:15,623
大空を強く翔けていたんだ
soared strongly across the vast sky.

82
00:10:15,723 --> 00:10:18,523
そして (生きる) 今を
And living in the present,

83
00:10:18,523 --> 00:10:23,123
見た事ない明日の先へ
we'll head beyond an unseen tomorrow!

84
00:10:23,223 --> 00:10:24,423
Yes, just believe

85
00:10:24,423 --> 00:10:29,923
1000年後の今日も 生まれ変わって歌いたい
A thousand years from now, I want to be reborn and sing today!

86
00:10:29,923 --> 00:10:33,223
暖かいよ この温もり
It's so warm, this warmth...

87
00:10:33,223 --> 00:10:36,223
絶対離さない
I'll never let it go!

88
00:10:36,223 --> 00:10:37,423
Just feeling

89
00:10:37,423 --> 00:10:43,223
運命なんてない 物語は自分にある
There's no such thing as destiny; the story belongs to us!

90
00:10:43,323 --> 00:10:44,423
Jump

91
00:10:44,423 --> 00:10:51,223
逃げ出したくなったら 宇宙を見上げよう
If you ever want to run away, look up at the cosmos!

92
00:10:51,223 --> 00:10:54,923
勇気こそが輝くんだよ
Courage is what truly shines!

93
00:10:54,923 --> 00:11:00,423
Singing star

94
00:11:28,223 --> 00:11:33,923
遥か (彼方) 星が (音楽となった…) あの日
That day in the far distance when the stars became music...

95
00:11:33,923 --> 00:11:37,223
たぶん (僕は) 君と (出会い)
Perhaps I met you,

96
00:11:37,223 --> 00:11:41,323
神話の一つのように紡いだ
and we spun together like a myth.

97
00:11:41,323 --> 00:11:44,423
何も (怖く) ないよ
There's nothing to fear,

98
00:11:44,423 --> 00:11:49,223
見た事ない世界の果てへ…
towards the ends of an unseen world...

99
00:11:54,423 --> 00:11:58,923
Yes, just believe

100
00:11:59,223 --> 00:12:05,223
神様も知らない 二人で歴史を創ろう
Unknown even to God, let's create our own history together!

101
00:12:05,223 --> 00:12:12,023
逆光のシャワー 未来照らす 一緒に飛ばないか
A shower of backlight illuminates the future—won't you fly with me?

102
00:12:12,123 --> 00:12:13,223
Just feeling

103
00:12:13,223 --> 00:12:18,623
涙で濡れた羽 重くて羽撃けない日は
On days when wings soaked in tears are too heavy to flap,

104
00:12:18,623 --> 00:12:19,723
Wish

105
00:12:19,723 --> 00:12:26,423
旋律は溶け合って シンフォニーへと
melodies melt together into a symphony.

106
00:12:26,423 --> 00:12:29,923
二人でなら 翼になれる
If we're together, we can become wings!

107
00:12:29,923 --> 00:12:33,223
Singing heart

108
00:12:33,223 --> 00:12:40,923
もっと高く 太陽よりも高く
Higher and higher, higher than the sun!

109
00:13:03,023 --> 00:13:05,023
UNHAPPY? 悩める人の子よ
Unhappy? O troubled child of man,

110
00:13:05,023 --> 00:13:07,023
UNLUCKY? 人成らざる者も
Unlucky? Even non-human beings,

111
00:13:07,023 --> 00:13:09,023
BE HAPPY! 弛まず目指せよ
Be happy! Strive for it tirelessly!

112
00:13:09,023 --> 00:13:11,223
生きているんだし 目を逸らした過去も
Since you're alive, both the past you looked away from

113
00:13:11,223 --> 00:13:13,323
退屈な未来も
and the boring future—

114
00:13:13,323 --> 00:13:16,723
カウンセリング やれやれ 古今東西 ピースピース
counseling them—good grief! Everywhere and always, peace peace!

115
00:13:16,823 --> 00:13:21,223
UNHAPPY? UNLUCKY? BE HAPPY!

116
00:13:21,323 --> 00:13:22,723
UNDEAD

117
00:13:29,223 --> 00:13:33,023
ねえ ねえ ねえ ねえ 何だかどうして 戦ってるようなそんな気がするの
Hey, hey, hey, hey, why do I feel like I'm fighting something?

118
00:13:33,123 --> 00:13:35,723
触れられない 触れたくもない
Can't touch, don't want to touch.

119
00:13:35,723 --> 00:13:39,823
過去の自分 自分 自分 自分とも もうとっくに死んでる 透明な亡霊と対決
Confronting my past self—an invisible ghost already long dead.

120
00:13:39,923 --> 00:13:43,223
幼気で痛い 記憶の奥
Deep in naive, painful memories.

121
00:13:43,223 --> 00:13:46,623
残念 もう居ないのに あれ？ そっちが良い？ アイロニーね
Too bad, they're not here anymore. Huh? You prefer that? How ironic.

122
00:13:46,623 --> 00:13:49,823
透かされているのは 現在の自分？
Is the one being seen through my current self?

123
00:13:49,823 --> 00:13:51,323
ナンセンス
Nonsense.

124
00:13:51,323 --> 00:13:53,223
消えないレッテル (Yes!)
An indelible label (Yes!)

125
00:13:53,223 --> 00:13:55,223
要はコンプレックス
In short, a complex.

126
00:13:55,223 --> 00:13:59,223
取り憑かれてるみたい 巻き付いたまま まだ離れの
Like being possessed, wrapped tight, still drifting apart,

127
00:13:59,223 --> 00:14:02,223
在りし日の自分
the self from days gone by.

128
00:14:02,323 --> 00:14:03,423
UNDEAD

129
00:14:03,423 --> 00:14:06,423
死んじゃない お前とお前の連鎖
Not dead yet—a continuous chain of you and you.

130
00:14:06,423 --> 00:14:10,123
生きていることとは 変わり続けることだ
To live means to keep changing!

131
00:14:10,123 --> 00:14:13,623
不幸に甘んじて 満足するなよ
Don't settle for misfortune and be satisfied!

132
00:14:13,623 --> 00:14:17,023
幸せになろうと しないなんて 卑怯だ
Refusing to try to be happy is sheer cowardice!

133
00:14:17,123 --> 00:14:20,223
この世 此の世は 奇怪 奇怪 ファンタジー
This world, this life is a bizarre, eerie fantasy.

134
00:14:20,223 --> 00:14:23,423
次は鬼が出るか 蛇が出るか
Will a demon appear next, or a snake?

135
00:14:23,423 --> 00:14:26,823
出逢って 逢って やっと始まる物語
Meeting and crossing paths, our story finally begins.

136
00:14:26,823 --> 00:14:30,423
さあ人か 化物か 閑話休題 ピースピース
Now, are you human or a monster? Anyway, peace peace!

137
00:14:30,423 --> 00:14:33,823
Past and Future, can't change the Past

138
00:14:33,823 --> 00:14:36,923
Past and Future, run for the Future

139
00:14:36,923 --> 00:14:37,723
カットイン
Cut in!

140
00:14:37,723 --> 00:14:42,323
何だかどうして 未来になんぞ 何の希望もない ような気がして
Somehow, for some reason, I feel like there's no hope for the future.

141
00:14:42,423 --> 00:14:46,323
もう随分生きてる 既視感とテンプレで食傷
Having lived this long, I'm sick of déjà vu and cliches.

142
00:14:46,423 --> 00:14:50,123
素敵な出来事の気配もない 残念
No sign of anything wonderful happening. Too bad!

143
00:14:50,223 --> 00:14:53,923
積んだ経験の因果 形骸化された神話と退屈な進化
The cause and effect of accumulated experience, a hollowed myth and tedious evolution.

144
00:14:54,023 --> 00:14:56,023
要は刺激が欲しいんだ (飽きちゃった 慣れちゃった)
Basically, I want excitement ("I'm bored, I'm used to it")

145
00:14:56,023 --> 00:15:00,023
なんて 整ってくガイダンス 増えるコンプライアンス
And yet, guidance gets tidied up, compliance increases,

146
00:15:00,023 --> 00:15:02,423
塞がれていくみたい 吸い尽くして
feeling like everything is blocked up—drain it dry!

147
00:15:03,711 --> 00:15:06,511
あれも これも どれも 吸い尽くして
Sucking everything dry, this, that, and that too,

148
00:15:06,511 --> 00:15:08,611
同じ味がする
they all taste the same.

149
00:15:08,811 --> 00:15:12,511
UNDEAD 死んじゃない お前とお前の連鎖
UNDEAD, you're not dead; this chain of you and you,

150
00:15:12,511 --> 00:15:16,411
何時の世も過去も未来も 現在にあるんだ
across any era, past and future, exists in the present!

151
00:15:16,411 --> 00:15:19,511
生きていることを 愚直に果たせよ
