まだ、離さないでいて。
don't let go of me just yet.

598
00:51:06,694 --> 00:51:08,094
Turn me up like this

599
00:51:20,094 --> 00:51:22,394
Wake up to this,

600
00:51:22,694 --> 00:51:25,894
Waking from a shallow sleep,

601
00:51:26,294 --> 00:51:32,194
形のない、夜に滲む知覚の様、
Shapeless, like perception blurring into the night,

602
00:51:33,294 --> 00:51:36,994
未完成な鼓動、またも煌々と輝く、
An unfinished heartbeat brightly shining once more,

603
