まだ、忘れないでいて。
don't forget me just yet.

617
00:52:28,194 --> 00:52:29,694
Turn me up like this

618
00:53:06,194 --> 00:53:10,094
共に限界まで Burning cross brave
Together to the limit, burning cross brave!

619
00:53:10,094 --> 00:53:11,594
Are you Ready? Fight!

620
00:53:11,694 --> 00:53:15,494
≪ X-BRAVERS ≫
[Song: X-BRAVERS]

621
00:53:16,194 --> 00:53:21,694
Lala... Rurila...

622
00:53:26,194 --> 00:53:31,494
何度地べたに這いずり 土を噛んだって
No matter how many times we crawled in the dirt and bit the dust,

623
00:53:31,694 --> 00:53:37,194
防ぎ合い背を任す 戦場に咲く友がいる
We guard and watch each other's backs—friends blooming on the battlefield.

624
00:53:37,294 --> 00:53:41,894
ガチンコ(本気)でシャバ(危険)なときも 何故か立ち向かえる
Even in serious and dangerous moments, somehow we can face them head-on.

625
00:53:42,094 --> 00:53:47,094
スフォルツァンドの臨界値まで フォルテの銀河に溺れよう
Up to the critical limit of sforzando, let's drown in a galaxy of forte!

626
00:53:47,294 --> 00:53:50,494
Buru-buru-buru-buru-buru-buru

627
00:53:50,494 --> 00:53:52,694
ブルったって突き出せる
Even if we tremble, we can break through!

628
00:53:52,694 --> 00:53:55,894
Buru-buru-buru-buru-buru-buru

629
00:53:55,894 --> 00:53:58,294
タフとしても振り絞れ
Even if it's tough, muster every bit of strength!

630
00:53:58,294 --> 00:54:02,694
人が創る想いの 答えを信じよう
Let's believe in the answer to the feelings that people create!

631
00:54:02,794 --> 00:54:07,494
ハートを震わせて 愛で殴れ
Make your heart tremble, strike with love!

632
00:54:07,494 --> 00:54:10,894
100度負けても101度目に勝てる
Even if we lose 100 times, we can win on the 101st!

633
00:54:10,894 --> 00:54:13,494
この力とは？ この絆とは？
What is this power? What is this bond?

634
00:54:13,494 --> 00:54:17,494
みんなが紡いだ 歌と響きだ
It's the song and resonance that everyone spun!

635
00:54:17,494 --> 00:54:20,694
交わる勇気 託し合って
Entrusting to each other the intersecting courage,

636
00:54:20,694 --> 00:54:22,094
Never give up!

637
00:54:22,094 --> 00:54:25,094
さあ夜明けへと
Now, onward to the dawn!

638
00:54:25,094 --> 00:54:28,394
怖さ 弱さ 涙は 千切って分け合い
Tear apart and share our fear, weakness, and tears,

639
00:54:28,394 --> 00:54:31,494
勝利を掴め！
and seize victory!

640
00:54:45,994 --> 00:54:50,694
握れば握るほどまた 開く意味を知り
The more I clench my fists, the more I know the meaning of opening them,

641
00:54:50,794 --> 00:54:55,994
相手の悲痛が伝わり 無刀の極みへ焦がれる
Feeling the opponent's grief, I yearn for the height of the swordless way.

642
00:54:56,094 --> 00:55:01,294
因縁の連鎖にこそ 撃鉄を起こせ…カッ！
Cock the hammer in the very chain of fate... fire!

643
00:55:01,294 --> 00:55:03,694
鎮魂歌(レクイエム)じゃなく 奏で合っ...
Rather than a requiem, we played together...

644
00:55:03,935 --> 00:58:54,203
Error processing subtitles for this segment.

